Maintainer: Erik Van Hamme <erik.vanhamme@gmail.com>
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Depends: python3, hd-desktop, libnotify-bin
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Description: HyprDebian laptop support
 Holds the parts of HyprDebian that only laptops need.
 .
 hd-battery shows the battery level in a notification of mako, with the
 time left until the battery is empty or full; the key binding
 SUPER + SHIFT + B runs it. The user unit hd-battery-monitor.service runs it
 in the desktop session to show a notification when the battery falls to
 50%, 25%, 10% and 5%, and when the charger is plugged in or pulled out.
